abstract: "Independent quantitative research on institutional holdings and market prices: common ownership of S&P 500 firms on 13F data, 13F amendments, deadline filing and turnover, a lagged-copy backtest of Citadel's 13F, hedge-fund pod divergence, and a Kalman-filter pairs trade on country ETFs, with a tested Python package for 13F work."
